================================================================================
SUB-PROJECTS / SUB-NAMES (alphabetical, all under XploreAlpha copyright)
================================================================================

The MatWAU codebase is organized as 17+ cooperating sub-projects.
Each sub-project is independently usable but designed to work best
as part of the full matrix. Sub-names are listed alphabetically.

Core agents (11):
  1.  mat-gen-agent             — 造物主 / crystal structure generator
  2.  mat-sim-agent             — 快速试菜员 / MLIP-based pre-screener (CHGNet)
  3.  mat-hpc-agent             — 超算对接员 / VASP + Slurm mock interface
  4.  mat-exp-agent             — 实验老师 / XRD Bragg peak decoder
  5.  mat-chemist-agent         — 化学师协调器 / multi-robot workflow coordinator
  6.  mat-intent-agent          — 翻译官 / 5-category user intent parser
  7.  mat-orchestrator          — DAG 调度器 / multi-experiment parallel runner
  8.  mat-critic-agent          — 裁决复核 / L1+L2+L3+L4 scoring + optional LLM review
  9.  mat-bayesian              — 主动学习 / TPE + GP + EI/UCB/PI
  10. mat-cost                  — 成本估算 / workflow budget guard
  11. mat-data-lineage          — 血缘记录 / Postgres + SQLite backend

Advanced / supporting modules:
  12. mat-lit                   — 图书管理员 / arXiv API + RAG
  13. mat-robot-synth           — 合成机器人 wrapper (Opentrons OT-2 mock)
  14. mat-robot-xrd             — XRD wrapper (Bruker .brml mock)
  15. mat-robot-em              — SEM wrapper (Zeiss SmartSEM .sxml mock)
  16. mat-robot-dsc             — DSC wrapper (TA Trios .csv mock)
  17. MaterialDomainRouter      — 材料域路由器 / 3-domain dispatch

Shared library (matwau/):
  - matwau.core.agent_base      — MatWAUAgentBase inner-loop base class
  - matwau.harness.*            — 5 Harness responsibilities
  - matwau.outer_loop.*         — failure-mining self-healing
  - matwau.configs.*            — matwau_settings factory

